      "id": "frag-10",
      "focal_uid": 10,
      "title": "The demand engine",
      "insight": "Demand for training and inference \u2014 fed by AI funding and the cost of capital \u2014 is the mediator the whole graph routes through, pushing on competition and the second-hand market. Hot demand keeps B200s scarce and pricey; a cooldown does the opposite.",
